.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/manual-testing-playbook/convergence-and-recovery/divergent-convergence-mode.md:30:- Expected execution process: Inspect the review legal-stop tree and exact divergent predicate, trace the successful branch away from synthesis, inspect `phase_synthesis` verdict derivation, then inspect candidate and seat-prompt read-only enforcement.
